The first build's time in plain words: a few minutes.

The companion said the first build takes "5 to 15 minutes" (Tolkara's own Install row, and the
hint pocket/patches/0037 gives while it builds). The time depends on the Mac, and a range read as
a promise: on Joe's Mac it was well under that (2026-11-13). "A few minutes" says what a player
needs to know. Applies after 0037 and 0038, whose text it edits.
Upstream note: Tolkara's row says "5 to 15 minutes"; the same wording would suit it.

